
# R / editor / OS working-state junk -- never commit, in any folder
.Rhistory
.DS_Store
.Rproj.user

# FUSE-mounted-filesystem temp files (created when a program deletes an open
# file on a network/cloud-sync mount, e.g. OneDrive's fuse layer): arbitrary
# leftover bytes, never meant to be read. 34 of these had been committed.
.fuse_hidden*

# R session-workspace dumps: personal working state, not a data product.
# opsin_explorer_data.RData is the one exception -- it's a real, used data
# bundle (built by setup_data.R, loaded by vertebrate_opsin_explorer/app.R).
*.RData
!vertebrate_opsin_explorer/opsin_explorer_data.RData

# Local agent / editor state — never commit
.claude/
